{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46653","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭莲 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见庭莲，风荷已飒然。\n开时闻馥郁，枕上正缠绵。\n本在沧江阔，移来碧沼圆。\n却思香社里，叶叶漏声连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}